✅ 7. Synchronized Method vs Normal Method

| Feature                         | Normal Method | Synchronized Method                                    |
| ------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| Thread Safe                     | ❌ No         | ✅ Yes (for shared state protected by the same monitor)|
| Lock Used                       | None          | `this` (instance methods)                              |
| Multiple Threads Simultaneously | ✅ Yes        | Only one per monitor                                  |